# Every text file is checked out with LF line ends on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# Git for Windows turns core.autocrlf on by default, which would give each script, configuration example and
# list a CR at the end of every line: the scripts still run, but a KEY=value value would carry the CR into a path.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.env.example text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jq text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
